:"١١٢","PageNumber":372,"JuzNumber":19,"ManzilNumber":5,"RukuNumber":321,"MaqraNumber":149,"HizbNumber":38,"HizbDecimal":0.0,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":26,"SurahIndex":"026","VerseNumber":113,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"إِنۡ حِسَابُهُمۡ إِلَّا عَلَىٰ رَبِّيۖ لَوۡ تَشۡعُرُونَ","TajweedText":"إِنْ حِسَابُهُمْ إِلَّا عَلَىٰ رَبِّى‌ۖ لَوْ تَشْعُر<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>١١٣</span>","End":"١١٣","PageNumber":372,"JuzNumber":19,"ManzilNumber":5,"RukuNumber":321,"MaqraNumber":149,"HizbNumber":38,"HizbDecimal":0.0,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":26,"SurahIndex":"026","VerseNumber":114,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَمَآ أَنَا۠ بِطَارِدِ ٱلۡمُؤۡمِنِينَ","TajweedText":"وَم<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َآ</tajweed> أَنَا۟ بِطَارِدِ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْمُؤْمِن<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>١١٤</span>","End":"١١٤","PageNumber":372,"JuzNumber":19,"ManzilNumber":5,"RukuNumber":321,"MaqraNumber":149,"HizbNumber":38,"HizbDecimal":0.0,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":26,"SurahIndex":"026","VerseNumber":115,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"إِنۡ أَنَا۠ إِلَّا نَذِيرٞ مُّبِينٞ","TajweedText":"إِنْ أَنَا۟ إِلَّا نَذِي<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>رٌ م</tajweed>ُّب<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>نٌ <span class=end>١١٥</span>","End":"١١٥","PageNumber":372,"JuzNumber":19,"ManzilNumber":5,"RukuNumber":321,"MaqraNumber":149,"HizbNumber":38,"HizbDecimal":0.0,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":26,"SurahIndex":"026","VerseNumber":116,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"قَالُواْ لَئِن لَّمۡ تَنتَهِ يَٰنُوحُ لَتَكُونَنَّ مِنَ ٱلۡمَرۡجُومِينَ","TajweedText":"قَالُو<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> لَئ<tajweed class=idgham_wo_ghunnah>ِن ل</tajweed>َّمْ تَ<tajweed class=ikhafa>نت</tajweed>َهِ يَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>نُوحُ لَتَكُونَ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َ مِنَ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>